WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Choose Add/Reinstall components.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.150
Click Next to keep this installation.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.400
Keep the app folder and click Next.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.700
Keep the Start Menu folder and click Install.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:17.650
Wait while Setup replaces the app files.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.650
At Installation Complete, click Next.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.300
Leave Run Phoenix Code checked and click Finish.
